graph TB
    subgraph Human Interface
        User[User Prompt / Feedback] <--> Chat[Chat Interface API]
    end

    subgraph LLM Brain & Planning
        LLM[Cognitive Routing Engine <br> LLM Brain] <--> Plan[Plan Manager <br> Hierarchical DAG / Task List]
        LLM <--> Eval[LLM-as-a-Judge <br> State Evaluator]
    end

    subgraph Memory Subsystems
        ShortMem[Short-Term Memory <br> Sliding Context Window] <--> LLM
        Episodic[Episodic Memory <br> Execution Logs & Rollback States] <--> LLM
        LongMem[Long-Term Memory <br> Vector Cache of Patterns & Docs] <--> LLM
    end

    subgraph Isolated Execution Sandbox (Docker Container)
        Terminal[Bash Terminal <br> Actuator & Sensor]
        Editor[File Editor / Patcher <br> Actuator & Sensor]
        Browser[Web Browser <br> Playwright / Chromium]
        Compiler[Compilers, Runtimes & Test Suites]
    end

    %% Execution Loop Flow
    User -->|Initiates Task| Chat
    Chat -->|Sends Context| LLM
    LLM -->|Consults| Plan
    Plan -->|Selects Next Action| LLM
    LLM -->|Invokes Tool Call| Editor
    LLM -->|Executes Command| Terminal
    LLM -->|Navigates Web| Browser
    
    Terminal -->|Terminal Outputs stdout/stderr| LLM
    Editor -->|File Diffs & Content| LLM
    Browser -->|Screenshots & DOM| LLM
    Compiler -->|Exit Codes & Error Traces| LLM

    LLM -->|Evaluates Execution State| Eval
    Eval -->|Success: Check off task| Plan
    Eval -->|Failure: Re-plan / Backtrack| Plan
    Plan -->|Final Deliverable| Chat
    Chat -->|Return Result| User
